4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fah42KPuXCQQ7kNvwG3MeNN&_nc_oc=AdoXRJQU106qo3iYQqUk0yVkDGYcSyN0pv810zR4LZStoFRHJ6pF99Ou8ZGXlSEYxB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8ZlKkYJ4FI8pIXciOzyqhOx2PhPhNzDDvjkPLPHPab0A&oe=6A47B354"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q4O_0cS6WkAQ7kNvwFMdx64&_nc_oc=AdqmDMPLxaa088u9MtwBuOPjHDptUHbIHKO0R6917SrKyMI0e_ZgaQgERDIygjlfL4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_5BjBtDcyoAP8Pv3fGpUbE4ieRDE4ihL3JAm6i-g4I5Q&oe=6A47B832"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bHLMVBfXa78Q7kNvwG-eVfw&_nc_oc=AdrkiuY5vKvK0ep1yxNSLq6eYB8dlom5v8sJFm9MDggNgejqgO-6Br7n9e7MPL_0puo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9rgblyVxrfpX_oS2VUXfg5y_oPy-UdCL186c2nHdMAnw&oe=6A47C5D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p